{"id":"sh/3qxwnyxw","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":158,"width":620,"height":37},"text":"A student has something to explain","style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#D7FC70","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/4r6xg3yh","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":203,"width":620,"height":114},"text":"The activity starts with a visible change. The student tests an interpretation and leaves with their own conclusion, supported by named observations.","style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#F5F6F5","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/psfep8f2","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":338,"width":620,"height":37},"text":"A teacher can inspect the reasoning","style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#D7FC70","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/itkv29g7","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":383,"width":620,"height":123},"text":"Give a class the same image pair, then compare their explanations. Each saved record shows which dates, wavelengths and quality evidence shaped the answer.","style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#F5F6F5","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/jutwbexs","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":516,"width":620,"height":37},"text":"A new question gives a reason to return","style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#D7FC70","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/zqlcfapg","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":561,"width":620,"height":111},"text":"Try another investigation, reopen saved work or search a new object. Astronomy clubs can debate the WISE feature and inspect the retained control together.","style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#F5F6F5","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/ypcb658v","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":747,"top":161,"width":485,"height":30},"text":"OPEN THE PROJECT","style":{"fontSize":19,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#D7FC70","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
